(61, 'H497', 'hotel-om-tara', 'Hotel Om Tara', 'Bhutan', 'Bhutan', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'FJ5V+QMV Changzamtog, Thimphu, Bhutan', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hotel+Om+Tara/@27.4594819,89.644159,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xb2704f368834a902?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjBn4CC1Yz7AhXr-TgGHdw5CeIQ_BJ6BAhoEAU', 'Hotel Om Tara offers an ultimate comfort with a unique hospitality experience and value for their money. Hotel Om Tara is a beautiful combination of Traditional Bhutanese grandeur and modern amenities. With much pleasure, we take this opportunity to introduce Thimphu city’s latest offering to the tourism industry, Om Tara Hotel. A TCB accredited 3-star hotel.', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-om-tara/1.webp', 1),
(62, 'H490', 'lemon-tree-hotel-thimphu', 'Lemon Tree Hotel, Thimphu', 'Bhutan', 'Bhutan', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Changlam #19 Thimphu, 11001, Bhutan', 'https://www.google.com/maps?hl=en-GB&gl=IN&um=1&ie=UTF-8&fb=1&sa=X&geocode=Ke-1DlC0leE5MS7MdBTOCoGA&daddr=Lemon+Tree+Hotel,+Thimphu,+Changlam+%2319+Thimphu,+11001,+Bhutan', 'Lemon Tree Hotel, Thimphu in Thimphu has 3-star accommodation with a bar. Among the facilities of this property are a restaurant, a 24-hour front desk and room service, along with free WiFi throughout the property. Private parking can be arranged at an extra charge. The rooms in the hotel are fitted with a flat-screen TV. At Lemon Tree Hotel, Thimphu rooms include a private bathroom', 'assets/images/hotels/lemon-tree-hotel-thimphu/1.webp', 1),
