(161, 'H553', 'corbett-treat-resort', 'Corbett Treat Resort®', 'Jim Corbett', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts', 'Village Dhela, Jhirna Tourist Zone, Jim Corbett National Park,, Ramnagar (Nainital), Uttarakhand 244715', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Corbett+Treat+Resort%C2%AE/@29.4069846,79.0053437,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xe17456d7e7da311e?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjG-o-bjJX7AhVVSmwGHTBJCugQ_BJ6BAhpEAU', 'Corbett Treat Resort is nestled in Dhela Village. The main attraction here is the Jim Corbett National Park. Away from the hustle-bustle of the city life, the area around the resort is lush with diverse flora and fauna, situated in the sub-Himalayan belt. The property is located at the distance of 15.7 km from Ramnagar Railway Station and the nearest airport is Pantnagar Airport. Guests can take bus/cabs once they reach to the rail or airhead. For added convenience of guests, the resort offers services like front desk, parking, housekeeping, indoor game zone, laundry, car hire and doctor on call service in case of any medical emergency. Guests can savour tempting regional and many multi cuisine delights in breakfast, lunch and dinner at the on-site restaurant. Guests can also avail dining in the privacy of their rooms with the prompt room service. The thoughtfully decorated rooms features air conditioner/heater, television, table, chairs, king size beds, clean linen and attached bathrooms come with shower jet, hot/cold water and essential toiletries. Guests who want to explore the area around the national park can avail the service of sightseeing, some of the famous attractions are Corbett Fall, Garjia Devi Temple, Hanuman Temple and Corbett Museum. Guests can also enjoy an adventurous activities on demand like jeep/elephant safari. Embrace the serene atmosphere of Jim Corbett National Park and have a peaceful stay at Corbett Treat Resort !!!', 'assets/images/hotels/corbett-treat-resort/1.webp', 1),
(162, 'H727', 'country-inn-resort-tarika-riverside-jim-corbett', 'COUNTRY INN RESORT TARIKA RIVERSIDE - Jim Corbett', 'Jim Corbett', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'INTERNAL', 'resorts', 'Ladwa Chaur, Jim Corbett National Park, Dhikuli, Ramnagar, Uttarakhand 244715', NULL, 'COUNTRY INN RESORT TARIKA RIVERSIDE is located in Jim Corbett, India. Its address is Ladwa Chaur, Jim Corbett National Park, Dhikuli, Ramnagar, Uttarakhand 244715. Popular places to visit in Jim Corbett include Jim Corbett National Park, Corbett Falls and Garjiya Devi Temple.', 'assets/images/hotels/country-inn-resort-tarika-riverside-jim-corbett/1.webp', 1),
(163, 'H726', 'gajraj-resort-and-spa-jim-corbett', 'GAJRAJ RESORT & SPA - Jim Corbett', 'Jim Corbett', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'INTERNAL', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Corbett Natonal Park Ramnagar Dhela Ramnagar, North Jaspur Range, Uttarakhand 244715', NULL, 'GAJRAJ RESORT & SPA is located in Jim Corbett, India. Its address is Corbett Natonal Park Ramnagar Dhela Ramnagar, North Jaspur Range, Uttarakhand 244715. Popular places to visit in Jim Corbett include Jim Corbett National Park, Corbett Falls and Garjiya Devi Temple.', 'assets/images/hotels/gajraj-resort-and-spa-jim-corbett/1.webp', 1),
(164, 'H261', 'the-golden-tusk-jim-corbett', 'THE GOLDEN TUSK JIM CORBETT', 'Jim Corbett', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d13902.086694216883!2d79.0021337!3d29.4135458!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x3dc9fd74ea78293c!2sThe%20Golden%20Tusk!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1630227394429!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'Besides the Jim Corbett National Park, nestled snugly amidst 8 acres of greenery and tranquillity and on the banks of the serene, soothing monsoon river Dhela is The Golden Tusk Resort in Ramnagar. Situated in the peacefulcountryside in the neighbourhoodof Ramnagar, the resort resides on the edge of the forest reserve and is just a 5-minute drive away from the Jhirna and Dhela Safari zones. The resort is also well connected to some of the great tourist attractions such as the Garjiya Devi temple and The Jim Corbett Museum.', 'assets/images/hotels/the-golden-tusk-jim-corbett/1.webp', 1),
(165, 'H750', 'tiaraa-hotels-and-resorts', 'Tiaraa Hotels & Resorts', 'Jim Corbett', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts', 'Jim Corbett, Shivlalpur Pandey, Ramnagar, Uttarakhand 244715', '-', 'Set along National Highway 309, this laid-back hotel is 3 km from access to Jim Corbett National Park and 17 km from Girija Devi Temple.\n\nUnpretentious rooms provide Wi-Fi, minibars, and tea and coffeemaking facilities. Some have sitting areas. In-room dining is available 24/7.\n\nAmenities consist of a play area, sports courts and a spa, plus a restaurant, and meeting and event space. There\'s also an outdoor pool and a poolside bar. Breakfast is available.', 'assets/images/hotels/tiaraa-hotels-and-resorts/1.webp', 1),
(166, 'H773', 'vanasthali-jungle-resort-corbett', 'Vanasthali Jungle Resort Corbett', 'Jim Corbett', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts', 'Chhoi, Ramnagar, Uttarakhand 244715', '-', 'Stay at Vanasthali Jungle Resort Corbett in Jim Corbett, India. The address is Chhoi, Ramnagar, Uttarakhand 244715. Popular places to visit in Jim Corbett include Jim Corbett National Park, Corbett Falls and Garjiya Devi Temple.', 'assets/images/hotels/vanasthali-jungle-resort-corbett/1.webp', 1),
(167, 'H725', 'winsome-resort-and-spa-jim-corbett', 'Winsome Resort & Spa - Jim Corbett', 'Jim Corbett', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'INTERNAL', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Vilage Nandpur, Choi, Gabua (Near Dabka River Jim Corbett National Park, Khempur, Uttarakhand 263140', NULL, 'Winsome Resort & Spa is located in Jim Corbett, India. Its address is Vilage Nandpur, Choi, Gabua (Near Dabka River Jim Corbett National Park, Khempur, Uttarakhand 263140. Popular places to visit in Jim Corbett include Jim Corbett National Park, Corbett Falls and Garjiya Devi Temple.', 'assets/images/hotels/winsome-resort-and-spa-jim-corbett/1.webp', 1),
(168, 'H358', 'fairfield-by-marriott-jodhpur', 'Fairfield by Marriott Jodhpur', 'Jodhpur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d14317.46660447793!2d73.0448594!3d26.2172736!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x924c5909fab7c86f!2sFairfield%20by%20Marriott%20Jodhpur!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1632477884912!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'This relaxed hotel in a modern building is 6 km from the All India Institute of Medical Sciences, 10 km from Jodhpur Airport, and 16 km from the Mehrangarh Fort and Museum.\n\nStraightforward rooms with floor-to-ceiling windows feature high-speed Wi-Fi (fee), flat-screen TVs and minifridges. Suites add separate living areas. Room service is offered 24/7.\n\nA casual restaurant serves international cuisine. There\'s also a cocktail bar. Other amenities include a fitness room and meeting space. Breakfast is available for an additional charge.', 'assets/images/hotels/fairfield-by-marriott-jodhpur/1.webp', 1),
(169, 'H557', 'park-plaza-jodhpur', 'Park Plaza Jodhpur', 'Jodhpur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'House, Jhalamand, Airport Rd, Jodhpur, Rajasthan 342011', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Park+Plaza+Jodhpur/@26.2684362,73.0383211,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xb0d5f329554cdc9d?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwijmrajkJX7AhV6T2wGHRvxBsoQ_BJ6BAh0EAU', 'Park Plaza Jodhpur is a vibrant, contemporarily designed, state-of-the-art boutique hotel, ideally located in the heart of the city. The 65 elegantly designed guest rooms and suites include mini bars, satellite cable TV, safe deposit vaults, WIFI, tea/ coffee makers and bath room with telephones. The assorted dining options include Oasis the coffee shop, Gardenia the pool side open air restaurant and Geoffrey\'s the English Pub.', 'assets/images/hotels/park-plaza-jodhpur/1.webp', 1),
(170, 'H555', 'radisson-hotel-jodhpur', 'Radisson Hotel Jodhpur', 'Jodhpur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Gaurav Path, 8, Residency Rd, Air Force Area, Jodhpur, Rajasthan 342001', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Radisson+Hotel+Jodhpur/@26.264314,73.031186,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x53680c073553a75c?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiN3e3bjpX7AhVyT2wGHYEGCUEQ_BJ6BAhsEAU', 'Welcome to Radisson Jodhpur, a boutique hotel that blends ancient-style architecture with modern amenities for a memorable stay in the Sun City. Our upscale property provides vegetarian dining options and proximity to destinations like Ghanta Ghar and Mandore Garden. When you aren’t sifting through 15th-century artefacts at Mehrangarh Fort, sit amidst the lush greens on our hotel grounds to admire. Perfect For Destination Weddings with ample indoor and out door Banquet Space.', 'assets/images/hotels/radisson-hotel-jodhpur/1.webp', 1),
(171, 'H293', 'the-ummed-jodhpur', 'THE UMMED JODHPUR', 'Jodhpur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d14304.640378790391!2d73.118178!3d26.321315!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x427e105428e4c26e!2sThe%20Ummed%20Jodhpur%20Palace%20Resort%20%26%20Spa!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1631011167065!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'A majestic tribute to the deep-rooted culture and heritage of Marwar, The Ummed Jodhpur is a place where time stands still and where each day is a new celebration. Nestled in the dramatic natural beauty of lush green gardens, the 28-acre five star palace resort is an architectural masterpiece of India’s most celebrated architects, Hafeez Contractor. It is a tranquil oasis at the edge of The Thar that takes you on an enchanting Rajasthani voyage. It recreates the grandeur of the land through awe-inspiring landscapes; and impressive structural details like jalis, jharokhas and domes that together narrate endless stories from a beautiful past.\n\nA grand palatial driveway welcomes you into the resort, through a lofty porte-cochere, to be received with a classical Rajasthani ceremony at the Marwar Lobby. It is bedecked with folk paintings and artefacts that warm you up to what awaits inside. Our 80 luxuriously designed rooms and 8 grand suites manifest an expansive mix of vintage Marwari and colonial royalty with all modern conveniences. The vast complex offers several indoor and outdoor venues with an overall capacity in thousands, with a choice of eclectic food and beverage services, making it a perfect destination for personal and social jamborees.', 'assets/images/hotels/the-ummed-jodhpur/1.webp', 1),
(172, 'H357', 'the-ummed-jodhpur-palace-resort-and-spa', 'The Ummed Jodhpur Palace Resort & Spa', 'Jodhpur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'INTERNAL', 'resorts; heritage-homes; castles; wellness-retreats', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d14304.640378790391!2d73.118178!3d26.321315!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x427e105428e4c26e!2sThe%20Ummed%20Jodhpur%20Palace%20Resort%20%26%20Spa!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1632477655190!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'Set on more than 11 hectares of gardens, this stately hotel is 13 km from the 15th-century Mehrangarh Fort and Museum, and 16 km from Bal Samand Lake. It\'s 3 km from Jodhpur Cantt train station.\n\nWarm rooms feature Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs and sitting areas, as well as garden views. Suites add separate living rooms and dining tables. Upgraded suites provide private bars and 24-hour room service.\n\nAmenities include 2 restaurants (1 outdoor), a beer garden, and a bar with a billiard table and exposed-beam ceilings. There\'s also an outdoor pool, a gym and a grand lobby sitting area. Parking and breakfast are available, as is meeting and event space.', 'assets/images/hotels/the-ummed-jodhpur-palace-resort-and-spa/1.webp', 1),
(173, 'H356', 'zone-by-the-park-hotel-jodhpur', 'Zone by The Park Hotel, Jodhpur', 'Jodhpur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d14312.396857563066!2d73.0071426!3d26.2584432!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x51c6e9f49719a5dc!2sZone%20by%20The%20Park%20Hotel%2C%20Jodhpur!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1632477420429!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'In the lively city centre, this trendy hotel is 4 km from Bhagat Ki Kothi train station, and 6 km from the circa 1460 Mehrangarh fort and the lavish Umaid Bhawan Palace.\n\nCasual rooms with a contemporary vibe provide free Wi-Fi, HDTVs, safes and minifridges. All feature sitting areas, and tea and coffeemaking facilities; some have city or palace views. Upgraded rooms (some with dining table) add MP3 docks and sofabeds.\n\nBreakfast is complimentary. There\'s a chic cocktail lounge, and a hip 24-hour cafe/bar with live music, and fort and palace views. Other amenities include a gym and a kids\' play area, along with indoor and outdoor event spaces.', 'assets/images/hotels/zone-by-the-park-hotel-jodhpur/1.webp', 1),
(174, 'KDG02', 'hotel-himalayan-retreat', 'Hotel Himalayan Retreat', 'Kandaghat', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'INTERNAL', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Hotel Himalayan Retreat, Main Road, Kandaghat, India', 'https://maps.google.com/?q=Hotel%20Himalayan%20Retreat%20Kandaghat', 'Experience luxury hospitality at Hotel Himalayan Retreat in Kandaghat, featuring modern amenities and exceptional service.', NULL, 1),
