(221, 'H512', 'comfort-inn-hyde-park', 'Comfort Inn Hyde Park', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', '73 Queensborough Terrace, London W2 3SU, United Kingdom', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Comfort+Inn+Hyde+Park,+73+Queensborough+Terrace,+London+W2+3SU,+United+Kingdom/@51.5109507,-0.2553057,12z/data=!4m8!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x487605539d175bd3:0x9684ca763f92d411!2m2!1d-0.1852662!2d51.5109716?hl=en-GB', 'Located in London City Centre neighborhood, Comfort Inn Hyde Park is connected to a shopping center. Buckingham Palace and Big Ben are notable landmarks, and travelers looking to shop may want to visit Oxford Street and Westfield London Shopping Centre. Looking to enjoy an event or a game? See what\'s going on at O2 Arena or Wembley Stadium. Guests love the hotel\'s convenience to public transportation: Queensway Underground Station is 3 minutes by foot and Bayswater Underground Station is 5 minutes', 'assets/images/hotels/comfort-inn-hyde-park/1.webp', 1),
(222, 'H400', 'dorsett-city-london', 'Dorsett City, London', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', NULL, NULL, 'Next to a tube station, this polished hotel surrounded by offices and eateries is an 8-minute walk from Leadenhall Market, an ornate covered shopping plaza, and a mile from cultural events at the Barbican Centre. Featuring floor-to-ceiling windows, the chic rooms come with free Wi-Fi, loaner smartphones, flat-screen TVs and iPod docks, plus tea and coffeemaking facilities. Upgraded rooms provide minibars. Suites add separate living rooms.\n\nAmenities include a rooftop bar and 2 modern restaurants (1 Chinese/British fusion; 1 serving casual fare and afternoon tea). There\'s also a 24/7 gym.', 'assets/images/hotels/dorsett-city-london/1.webp', 1),
(223, 'H398', 'doubletree-by-hilton-hotel-london-tower-of-london', 'DoubleTree by Hilton Hotel London - Tower of London', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', NULL, NULL, 'Within a 7-minute walk of the Tower of London and Tower Bridge, this modern hotel in the City district is also 3 miles from the British Museum. Relaxed rooms offer Wi-Fi (fee), flat-screen TVs and floor-to-ceiling windows, as well as custom-designed beds and minifridges. Suites add separate living areas, and minibars, plus access to a lounge with complimentary breakfast, evening canapés and drinks.\n\nThere’s a chic rooftop bar with floor-to-ceiling windows, DJs and a terrace with city views, as well as a lobby bar and an airy cafe. Additional amenities include 24-hour gym, meeting rooms and a business centre.', 'assets/images/hotels/doubletree-by-hilton-hotel-london-tower-of-london/1.webp', 1),
(224, 'H510', 'premier-inn-london-wembley-stadium-hotel', 'Premier Inn London Wembley Stadium hotel', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', '1 Wembley Park Blvd, London, Wembley HA9 0GG, United Kingdom', 'https://www.google.com/maps?hl=en-GB&gl=IN&um=1&ie=UTF-8&fb=1&sa=X&geocode=KWOLi2AQE3ZIMTR1zQu1C5H7&daddr=Premier+Inn+London+Wembley+Stadium+hotel,+1+Wembley+Park+Blvd,+London,+Wembley+HA9+0GG,+United+Kingdom', 'For a central stay in North West London, look no further than our Premier Inn London Wembley Stadium hotel. You\'ll have all the best attractions right on your doorstep - Wembley Arena is only a 5-minute walk away, ideal if you\'re catching a show, and you\'ll only be 10 minutes away from the famous Wembley Stadium. Wembley is also home to the London Designer Outlet, a must-visit spot for shopaholics thanks to its exciting range of stores, bars and restaurants. If you don\'t fancy splashing out on the high-street, though, you can always head back to the hotel and enjoy a delicious meal at our in-house Thyme restaurant', 'assets/images/hotels/premier-inn-london-wembley-stadium-hotel/1.webp', 1),
(225, 'H511', 'ramada-by-wyndham-london-north-m1', 'Ramada by Wyndham London North M1', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Ramada London North –Mill Hill Between Jct 2-4, M1, London NW7 3HU, United Kingdom', 'https://www.google.com/maps?hl=en-GB&gl=IN&um=1&ie=UTF-8&fb=1&sa=X&geocode=KY8nqWSOFnZIMT28o28Ovdge&daddr=Ramada+by+Wyndham+London+North+M1,+Ramada+London+North+%E2%80%93Mill+Hill+Between+Jct+2-4,+M1,+London+NW7+3HU,+United+Kingdom', 'Ramada London North offers free Wi-Fi, free parking and excellent access to the M1 motorway. Central London is 9 miles away. All of the spacious, air conditioned rooms have comfortable beds and satellite TV. Edgware Tube Station is 3 miles away. Dine at the onsite Indigo Restaurant or relax in the bar, with a plasma-screen TV showing sports. Children under the age of 12 years stay and eat free. Discounted breakfast and dinner rates are available if booked at the time of online reservation', 'assets/images/hotels/ramada-by-wyndham-london-north-m1/1.webp', 1),
(226, 'H798', 'hilton-garden-inn-lucknow', 'Hilton Garden Inn Lucknow', 'Lucknow', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'TCG, 7/7, Vibhuti Khand, Gomti Nagar, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh 226010', NULL, 'Less than 1 km from Gomati Nagar train station, this modern hotel is 6 km from Ambedkar Park, a stone memorial with columns and statues. It\'s 8 km from the Lucknow Zoo.\n\nBright, contemporary rooms feature free Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs and sitting areas, as well as work desks, minifridges, and tea and coffeemaking facilities. Studio suites have living areas, while 1-bedroom suites add living and dining rooms. Room service is available.\n\nAmenities include a rooftop pool, a bar area and a fitness room, as well as a 24-hour market.', 'assets/images/hotels/hilton-garden-inn-lucknow/1.webp', 1),
(227, 'H799', 'hotel-arif-castles-lucknow', 'Hotel Arif Castles - Lucknow', 'Lucknow', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', '4, Rana Pratap Marg, Hazratganj, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh 226001', NULL, 'Set in a commercial area along the Gomti River, this casual business hotel is 3 km from Badshahnagar railway station and 4 km from the sprawling Bara Imambara monument.\n\nStraightforward rooms and suites feature Wi-Fi access, flat-screen TVs and work desks, plus minifridges, and/or tea and coffeemaking facilities. Room service is available 24/7.\n\nBreakfast is available. There\'s also a relaxed international restaurant and a cosy cafe.', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-arif-castles-lucknow/1.webp', 1),
(228, 'H797', 'ramada-by-wyndham-lucknow-hotel-and-convention-centre', 'Ramada by Wyndham Lucknow Hotel & Convention Centre', 'Lucknow', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Kanpur - Lucknow Rd, Junab Ganj, Katibagiya, Uttar Pradesh 226401', NULL, 'Set off a main road and next to a hospital, this polished hotel is 16 km from Chaudhary Charan Singh International Airport and 35 km from Unnao Sports Stadium.\n\nThe relaxed rooms feature flat-screen TVs, Wi-Fi, and tea and coffeemaking facilities. Some have sitting areas with sofas.\n\nAn airport shuttle service is complimentary. Other amenities include a restaurant, a fitness centre and a spa, as well as an outdoor infinity pool. There\'s also a game room with arcade games, and a kids\' play area. Breakfast and parking are available.', 'assets/images/hotels/ramada-by-wyndham-lucknow-hotel-and-convention-centre/1.webp', 1),
(229, 'H796', 'renaissance-lucknow-hotel', 'Renaissance Lucknow Hotel', 'Lucknow', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Vipin Khand, Gomti Nagar, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh 226010', NULL, 'Set in a sleek tower, this upscale hotel is an 8-minute walk from Ambedkar Memorial Park and 3 km from the Hazratganj shopping area.\n\nContemporary rooms feature flat-screens, free Wi-Fi and minibars, plus city or park views, and tea and coffeemakers. Club level rooms provide access a lounge offering free drinks and appetizers; suites add living areas with sofas. Room service is available 24/7.\n\nParking is free. Other amenities include international and regional restaurants, plus a cafe, a business centre and a gym. There\'s also a rooftop terrace with an infinity pool, a chic cocktail bar and city views. A breakfast buffet is available for a fee.', 'assets/images/hotels/renaissance-lucknow-hotel/1.webp', 1),
(230, 'H800', 'singhs-studio-at-dlf-mypad-gomtinagar-lucknoww', 'Singh’s Studio at DLF MyPad / Gomtinagar Lucknoww', 'Lucknow', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'DLF MyPAD, Vijaipur Colony, Vibhuti Khand, Gomti Nagar, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh 226010', NULL, 'Welcome to Concept Studios by the Nest Lucknow at DLF MyPad, a haven where imagination and comfort intertwine seamlessly. Our meticulously curated, fully furnished spaces are a testament to our commitment to creativity, featuring distinctive themes and delightful quirks that ensure each room is a unique experience. This creative approach has established us as the undisputed leader in our category, not just within the city, but across the entire region. We wholeheartedly embrace the same vision as our discerning travelers, reflecting in every detail. Expect nothing but the best from our sumptuous 10" mattresses designed for the most restful sleep, to the versatile Sofa Cum Bed for relaxation and convenience. Immerse yourself in entertainment with our expansive 50-inch (or larger) displays, or get down to business at our functional work tables and chairs. For added convenience, each room comes equipped with an induction kettle and a spacious full-size refrigerator, ensuring your stay is nothing short of exceptional. Choosing your space is a pivotal step towards a tailored experience. Your preferences matter, and by selecting with care, you enable us to go above and beyond in meeting your unique needs. Explore The Nest - where we redefine hospitality through exceptional stays, curated rentals, and exclusive experiences. PAY EXTRA FOR POOL / GYMNASIUM rs 236 PER 45 MINUTE SESSION', 'assets/images/hotels/singhs-studio-at-dlf-mypad-gomtinagar-lucknoww/1.webp', 1),
(231, 'H722', 'regenta-central-klassik-ludhiana', 'Regenta Central Klassik - Ludhiana', 'Ludhiana', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Link Rd, Model Town, Ludhiana, Punjab 141002', NULL, 'Regenta Central Klassik is a hotel in Ludhiana, India. Its address is Link Rd, Model Town, Ludhiana, Punjab 141002. Popular places to visit in Ludhiana include Nehru Rose Garden, Hardy\'s World Amusement Park and Maharaja Ranjit Singh War Museum.', 'assets/images/hotels/regenta-central-klassik-ludhiana/1.webp', 1),
(232, 'MBL01', 'brightland-resort-and-spa', 'Brightland Resort & Spa', 'Mahabaleshwar', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Brightland Resort & Spa, Main Road, Mahabaleshwar, India', 'https://maps.google.com/?q=Brightland%20Resort%20%26%20Spa%20Mahabaleshwar', 'Experience luxury hospitality at Brightland Resort & Spa in Mahabaleshwar, featuring modern amenities and exceptional service.', 'assets/images/hotels/brightland-resort-and-spa/1.webp', 1),
(233, 'MBL02', 'evershine-resort', 'Evershine Resort', 'Mahabaleshwar', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'INTERNAL', 'resorts', 'Evershine Resort, Main Road, Mahabaleshwar, India', 'https://maps.google.com/?q=Evershine%20Resort%20Mahabaleshwar', 'Experience luxury hospitality at Evershine Resort in Mahabaleshwar, featuring modern amenities and exceptional service.', 'assets/images/hotels/evershine-resort/1.webp', 1),
(234, 'H513', 'berjaya-times-square-hotel-kuala-lumpur', 'Berjaya Times Square Hotel, Kuala Lumpur', 'Malaysia', 'Malaysia', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', '1, Jln Imbi, Bukit Bintang, 55100 Kuala Lumpur, Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia', 'https://www.google.com/maps?hl=en-GB&gl=IN&um=1&ie=UTF-8&fb=1&sa=X&geocode=KaV-doYoNswxMTWlIGNoOQBv&daddr=Berjaya+Times+Square+Hotel,+Kuala+Lumpur,+1,+Jln+Imbi,+Bukit+Bintang,+55100+Kuala+Lumpur,+Federal+Territory+of+Kuala+Lumpur,+Malaysia', 'Berjaya Times Square Hotel, Kuala Lumpur, a five-star hotel under the hospitality arm of the public listed Malaysian conglomerate Berjaya Corporation, is a prominent landmark strategically located in the heart of the city’s banking, commercial and vibrant shopping district. With a total of 650 rooms & suites complete with international-standard amenities, the hotel also houses an extensive selection of food and beverage outlets and recreational facilities built exclusively with a children’s playground, swimming pool, steam and sauna room, fitness centre and two squash courts. Offering a distinctive Meetings Excellence programme; boasts 13 meeting rooms and a grand ballroom, Berjaya Times Square Hotel, Kuala Lumpur is definitely an excellent setting where business complements leisure', 'assets/images/hotels/berjaya-times-square-hotel-kuala-lumpur/1.webp', 1),
(235, 'H515', 'dorsett-hartamas-kuala-lumpur', 'Dorsett Hartamas Kuala Lumpur', 'Malaysia', 'Malaysia', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Plaza Damas, D-G-8 3, No. 63, Jalan Sri Hartamas 1, Sri Hartamas, 50480 Kuala Lumpur, Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia', 'https://www.google.com/maps?hl=en-GB&gl=IN&um=1&ie=UTF-8&fb=1&sa=X&geocode=KYuQZ7o8ScwxMWe29aPuemUV&daddr=Dorsett+Hartamas+Kuala+Lumpur,+Plaza+Damas,+D-G-8+3,+No.+63,+Jalan+Sri+Hartamas+1,+Sri+Hartamas,+50480+Kuala+Lumpur,+Federal+Territory+of+Kuala+Lumpur,+Malaysia', 'Dorsett Hartamas is a 4-star Sri Hartamas hotel, on the outskirts of Kuala Lumpur. Sri Hartamas is an affluent area, with a fast-developing local scene. Surrounding the hotel are numerous chic cafés, in-vogue eateries and bars, modern shopping malls and near to Malaysia\'s largest exhibition centre, MITEC (Malaysia International Trade and Exhibition Centre), all of which make Sri Hartamas a popular chill-out spot for young adults, new families alike and corporates. Inside our hotel are 290 rooms with all mod-con – and the rest of the hotel boasts fabulous facilities too. Keep up with your workout in our gymnasium, or take extra care and visit our health and wellness centre. If swimming’s more your style, try our rooftop sky pool, complete with wading pool and Jacuzzi – not to mention breathtaking views! Kids too can enjoy our children club room, while our cozy café provides all-day dining. For special occasions, we have 3 functions rooms for hire. Stay with us and see for yourself what Dorsett Hartamas has to offer', 'assets/images/hotels/dorsett-hartamas-kuala-lumpur/1.webp', 1),
(236, 'H514', 'hotel-transit-kuala-lumpur', 'Hotel Transit Kuala Lumpur', 'Malaysia', 'Malaysia', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', '42, Jln Pudu, Bukit Bintang, 55100 Kuala Lumpur, Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia', 'https://www.google.com/maps?hl=en-GB&gl=IN&um=1&ie=UTF-8&fb=1&sa=X&geocode=Kd9X0K3WScwxMZaJ3HkUis32&daddr=Hotel+Transit+Kuala+Lumpur,+42,+Jln+Pudu,+Bukit+Bintang,+55100+Kuala+Lumpur,+Federal+Territory+of+Kuala+Lumpur,+Malaysia', 'Set in an unbeatable location, you\'ll find the city\'s major business, shopping and entertainment districts just a few minutes away. Various modes of public transportation are also within reach, including the LRT, Monorail, KTM train stations, Pudu Sentral UTC and bus stops', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-transit-kuala-lumpur/1.webp', 1),
(237, 'H737', 'arena-beach-hotel-maldives', 'arena beach hotel maldives', 'Maldives', 'Maldives', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'WFRQ+GRW, Ziyaaraiy Magu Road, Maafushi 08090, Maldives', NULL, 'This colorful hotel in a modern building on a private beach is set on Maafushi island in the Maldives and is accessible by boat or seaplane from Malé.\n\nThe cozy rooms include flat-screen TVs, safes and minibars, as well as free Wi-Fi, balconies and bathrooms with rainfall showers. An upgraded room adds a private sundeck.\n\nA free breakfast buffet is served in a low-key restaurant. Guided excursions and activities such as diving, snorkeling and fishing are available.', 'assets/images/hotels/arena-beach-hotel-maldives/1.webp', 1),
(238, 'H738', 'kiha-beach-resort-maldives', 'kiha Beach resort maldives', 'Maldives', 'Maldives', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts; beach-houses', 'Kiha Beach, Dharavandhoo 06060, Maldives', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d15894.602009391629!2d73.1285387!3d5.159808!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3b6abf86ce512ecb%3A0x60d3fdcf87e0ee7!2sKiha%20Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1698041280064!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'Set along a white-sand beach on the Laccadive Sea, this sophisticated hotel in a modern whitewashed building is an 8-minute walk from Dharavandhoo Harbor and a 12-minute walk from Dharavandhoo Airport.\n\nFeaturing furnished balconies with sea views and beds with driftwood headboards, the stylish rooms offer free Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs and minifridges, as well as sitting areas, and tea and coffeemaking facilities. Upgraded rooms add free-standing tubs. Family quarters are available. Room service is provided.\n\nThere’s a relaxed open-air restaurant, a juice bar and an outdoor infinity pool. Diving, water sports and excursions are also available.', 'assets/images/hotels/kiha-beach-resort-maldives/1.webp', 1),
(239, 'H740', 'royal-island-resort-and-spa', 'Royal Island Resort & Spa', 'Maldives', 'Maldives', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Horubadhoo, Maldives', NULL, 'This luxe beachfront resort on a lagoon island in the Baa Atoll UNESCO biosphere reserve is 9 km by seaplane from Dharavandhoo Airport.\n\nSurrounded by tropical flora, the polished villas feature ocean-view decks, and wood-paneled walls and ceilings, plus flat-screens, minibars, and tea and coffeemaking facilities. Upgraded villas add Wi-Fi, private pools and hot tubs.\n\nAn upscale restaurant is centered around a natural pool. There\'s also an open-sided eatery serving Mediterranean dishes, as well as a laid-back pub with pool tables, and a swim-up bar in an outdoor pool. A tranquil spa offers steam rooms, saunas, and beauty and massage treatments.', 'assets/images/hotels/royal-island-resort-and-spa/1.webp', 1),
(240, 'H420', 'season-paradise', 'Season Paradise', 'Maldives', 'Maldives', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', NULL, NULL, 'On a white-sand beach along the Laccadive Sea, this informal hotel is 25 km by speedboat from Velana International Airport. Featuring wood floors and private balconies, the warmly decorated rooms come with flat-screen TVs, minibars, and tea and coffeemakers. Upgraded rooms have sea views, and suites add sitting areas.\n\nThere\'s a contemporary, air-conditioned restaurant that also offers beachfront dining. Other amenities include an outdoor rooftop infinity pool overlooking the sea, plus a gym, a spa and a kids\' play area. Water sports and regular live music are offered.', 'assets/images/hotels/season-paradise/1.webp', 1)
INSERT INTO `hotels` (id, hotel_code, slug, name, location_name, country, location_type, hotel_type, category, stay_types, address, map_link, description, image_path, is_published) VALUES
(241, 'H739', 'the-barefoot-eco-hotel', 'The Barefoot Eco Hotel', 'Maldives', 'Maldives', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels; eco-lodges', 'N 6 45 E 73 10, Hanimaadhoo, Maldives', NULL, 'Set on a private beach on Hamimaadhoo Island, this serene, secluded ecolodge is a 10-minute walk from Hanimaadhoo Social Center and 3 km from Hanimaadhoo International Airport.\n\nWarm, airy rooms feature free Wi-Fi, tea and coffeemaking equipment, safes and minibars, plus verandas with beach access, or balconies offering ocean views.\n\nThere\'s a juice bar, a waterside bar, and a Mediterranean buffet restaurant. Other amenities include a library, a gym and a boutique, as well as a conference room, a spa, and conservation center with resident marine biologists.', 'assets/images/hotels/the-barefoot-eco-hotel/1.webp', 1),
(242, 'H713', 'ahr-grace-resort-and-spa-manali-a-mountain-view-resort-manali', 'AHR Grace Resort & Spa,Manali (A Mountain View Resort) - Manali', 'Manali', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'INTERNAL', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Simsa Village, Manali, Himachal Pradesh 175131', NULL, 'AHR Grace Resort & Spa,Manali (A Mountain View Resort) is located in Manali, India. Its address is Simsa Village, Manali, Himachal Pradesh 175131. Popular places to visit in Manali include Solang Valley, Rohtang Pass and Hadimba Devi Temple.', 'assets/images/hotels/ahr-grace-resort-and-spa-manali-a-mountain-view-resort-manali/1.webp', 1),
(243, 'H580', 'coral-resort-and-spa', 'Coral Resort And Spa', 'Manali', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Kullu - Naggar - Manali Road, Shuru Rd, Manali, Himachal Pradesh 175131', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Coral+Resort+And+Spa/@32.2150874,77.1975756,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xcbcad33f61dec42?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwj9jPu4ipr7AhXrUGwGHfRmDK8Q_BJ6BAhmEAU', 'The Coral Resort And Spa is a luxurious resort enriched with world class facilities and comfort. It is a stylish property going ranking high in hospitality. The Resort welcomes you for an indelible vacation and destination wedding With Banquet And Lawn Facility which can cover Up to 500 Pax in Manali. Location is just 4 Kms, from Mall road Manali. Coral resort & Spa is a good option for leisure', 'assets/images/hotels/coral-resort-and-spa/1.webp', 1),
(244, 'H300', 'honeymoon-inn-manali', 'honeymoon inn manali', 'Manali', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d13499.59492756845!2d77.1963157!3d32.2338931!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0xcda3a9389dca6b0e!2sHoneymoon%20Inn!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1631077658225!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'honeymoon inn manali is a hotel in Manali, India. Popular places to visit in Manali include Solang Valley, Rohtang Pass and Hadimba Devi Temple.', 'assets/images/hotels/honeymoon-inn-manali/1.webp', 1),
(245, 'H459', 'the-manali-inn', 'The Manali Inn', 'Manali', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Rangree, Manali, Himachal Pradesh 175131', NULL, 'Welcome to The Manali Inn\nThe Manali Inn is a luxury hotel in Manali. The hotel is well equipped with the latest amenities that define the luxury hospitality. The Manali Inn offers a unique holiday experience and also has state-of-the-art banqueting facilities to help you host corporate and social events.\n\nThe Manali Inn has a lively décor featuring paintings, classy furnishings and landscaped outdoors.\n\nAt The Manali Inn hotel, we also offer accessibility features like online Manali hotel bookings, guided sightseeing and tours, airport and bus stand pickup and drops and many more such facilities. That’s why we are ranked amongst the best hotels and hotels in Manali, and our patrons keep coming back for the warm hospitality we offer.', 'assets/images/hotels/the-manali-inn/1.webp', 1),
(246, 'H579', 'the-orchard-greens-resort-and-spa', 'The Orchard Greens Resort & Spa', 'Manali', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Log Huts Area Rd, Old Manali, Manali, Himachal Pradesh 175131', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Orchard+Greens+Resort+%26+Spa/@32.2503254,77.1786875,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x972b830f6482e15d?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiirbK0iZr7AhX9SmwGHV31BG8Q_BJ6BAh5EAU', 'The orchard green resort and spa is beyond an address. It’s a curated experience for you to make your holidays memorable. Rooms, Spas, banquet facilities, multi-cuisine restaurants and amenities are added benefits; your moments with nature is what we offer to you as our specialty. Come-Experience Manali like never before!', 'assets/images/hotels/the-orchard-greens-resort-and-spa/1.webp', 1),
(247, 'H712', 'the-orchard-greens-resort-and-spa-manali', 'The Orchard Greens Resort & Spa - Manali', 'Manali', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'INTERNAL', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Log Huts Area Rd, Old Manali, Manali, Himachal Pradesh 175131', NULL, 'Located in Manali, India, The Orchard Greens Resort & Spa is part of the Galaxy Heritage World network of hotels and resorts. Find it at Log Huts Area Rd, Old Manali, Manali, Himachal Pradesh 175131. Popular places to visit in Manali include Solang Valley, Rohtang Pass and Hadimba Devi Temple.', 'assets/images/hotels/the-orchard-greens-resort-and-spa-manali/1.webp', 1),
(248, 'H711', 'fortune-park-orange-sidhrawali-hotel-in-gurgaon-manesar', 'Fortune Park Orange, Sidhrawali - Hotel in Gurgaon - Manesar', 'Manesar', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'K.M. Stone 67, NH-8, Near Raman Munjal Hospital, Sidhrawali, Gurgaon, Haryana 122413', NULL, 'Located in Manesar, India, Fortune Park Orange, Sidhrawali is part of the Galaxy Heritage World network of hotels and resorts. Find it at K.M. Stone 67, NH-8, Near Raman Munjal Hospital, Sidhrawali, Gurgaon, Haryana 122413. Popular places to visit in Manesar include Heritage Transport Museum, Manesar Golf Course and Damdama Lake.', 'assets/images/hotels/fortune-park-orange-sidhrawali-hotel-in-gurgaon-manesar/1.webp', 1),
(249, 'H583', 'holiday-inn-gurugram-sector-90-an-ihg-hotel', 'Holiday Inn Gurugram Sector 90, an IHG Hotel', 'Manesar', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Sector 90, Gurugram, Haryana 122505', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Holiday+Inn+Gurugram+Sector+90,+an+IHG+Hotel/@28.4036975,76.9362499,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x3a6abfb0bc5a1884?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiJzNHZjZr7AhV6cGwGHS-UAyYQ_BJ6BAh4EAU', 'Holiday Inn Gurugram Sector 90 is located in the heart of the New Gurugram & in close proximity to the Ancillary district. Our great location offers easy accessibility to the Manesar, Business District and City Centre. The hotel features 263 thoughtfully designed comfortable rooms with modern decor that offers everything one needs for a great stay. We are in a mixed-use complex of shopping mall, variety of entertainment facilities (Inox movie hall & restaurants etc.) are opening soon, which makes us a perfect lifestyle destination for a business visitors, people on vacation & leisure travelers.', 'assets/images/hotels/holiday-inn-gurugram-sector-90-an-ihg-hotel/1.webp', 1),
(250, 'H581', 'hyatt-regency-gurgaon', 'Hyatt Regency Gurgaon', 'Manesar', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Hyatt Regency, Business Hotel in Gurgaon, sector 83, NH8, opp. southern peripheral road, Sector 83, Gurugram, Haryana 122004', 'https://www.google.com/travel/hotels/Manesar%2C%20Gurugram%2C%20Haryana/entity/CgsIxubq1LOdg9nJARAB/location?q=manesar%205%20star%20hotels&g2lb=2502548%2C2503771%2C2503781%2C4258168%2C4270442%2C4284970%2C4291517%2C4306835%2C4597339%2C4718358%2C4723331%2C4731329%2C4757164%2C4814050%2C4816977%2C4821091%2C4852066%2C4861688%2C4864715%2C4878645%2C4885161%2C4886479%2C4887074%2C4891509%2C4892547%2C4893075%2C4894401&hl=en-IN&gl=in&ssta=1&ts=CAESABogCgIaABIaEhQKBwjmDxALGBMSBwjmDxALGBQYATICEAAqDAoIEgEFOgNJTlIaAA&rp=EOKq2dDJvp3myAEQm9iyiJDWtvgOEMbm6tSznYPZyQEQyYaG5umglovPATgBQABIAqIBGk1hbmVzYXIsIEd1cnVncmFtLCBIYXJ5YW5hwAEDmgICCAA&ap=aAE&ictx=1&utm_campaign=sharing&utm_medium=link&utm_source=htls', 'Hyatt Regency Gurgaon is one of the largest five-star convention hotels in Gurgaon with the meeting and event facility to accommodate up to 3000 people. It is strategically located in the rapidly expanding corporate and residential hub of India off the Delhi-Jaipur National Highway 8. Located in close proximity to corporate business hub of Gurgaon and IMT Manesar, with easy access from southern periphery road and Dwarka express highway, the hotel is an ideal weekend getaway for Delhi NCR residents and offers a convenient stop over for tourists covering the ‘Golden Triangle’ of Delhi, Agra and Jaipur. Guided by our purpose of care, we’re committed to enhanced levels of cleanliness in an effort to ensure your safety and wellbeing.', 'assets/images/hotels/hyatt-regency-gurgaon/1.webp', 1),
(251, 'H582', 'savoy-suites-manesar', 'Savoy Suites, Manesar', 'Manesar', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'R 75, Sector 1 Main Rd, Sector 1, Imt Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana 122051', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Savoy+Suites,+Manesar/@28.3663857,76.943799,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xcf1659069cc18349?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjfkp7KjJr7AhXnUGwGHZx7DaYQ_BJ6BAh8EAU', 'Each suite features many thoughtful details and amenities to enable a comfortable stay at Savoy Suites. There is a well furnished living room, a well equipped Italian kitchenette, a comfortable bedroom with an attached bath. When work beckons, your apartment doubles up as a home office with Wi-Fi broad band internet connectivity, direct dial phone and an international multi-plug port to power up all your accessories.', 'assets/images/hotels/savoy-suites-manesar/1.webp', 1),
(252, 'H586', 'brijwasi-centrum', 'Brijwasi Centrum', 'Mathura', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Near New Bus Stand and, Bhuteshwar Rd, near New Railway Station, Mathura, Uttar Pradesh 281001', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Brijwasi+Centrum/@27.4922607,77.6741446,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xd0bf5b24165965e9?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjw0pDqxpz7AhXDSWwGHZdAAZIQ_BJ6BAhkEAU', 'Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travellers visiting Mathura, Centrum Hotel by Brijwasi is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its budget friendly environment and proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Centrum Hotel by Brijwasi makes it easy to enjoy the best of Mathura.\n\nAs your “home away from home,” the small hotel rooms offer a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a desk, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.\n\nGuests have access to 24 hour front desk and baggage storage while staying at Centrum Hotel by Brijwasi. In addition, Centrum Hotel by Brijwasi offers an on-site restaurant, which will help make your Mathura trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.\n\nFor those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Mathura, Centrum Hotel by Brijwasi is located a short distance from Vishram Ghat (1.4 mi) and Mansi Ganga Tank (1.4 mi).\n\nWhile you’re here, be sure to check out some of the cafes, including Dosa Plaza Divinity, Giani\'s Ice cream Parlour, and Cafe Coffee Day, all of which are a short distance from Centrum Hotel by Brijwasi.\n\nLooking for something to do in Mathura? Krishna Janmabhoomi Mandir (0.9 mi), Sri Krishna Janmabhoomi Temple Complex (0.6 mi), and Govardhan Hill (1.1 mi) are some popular attractions that are within walking distance of Centrum Hotel by Brijwasi.\n\nCentrum Hotel by Brijwasi is sure to make your visit to Mathura one worth remembering.', 'assets/images/hotels/brijwasi-centrum/1.webp', 1),
(253, 'H710', 'brijwasi-land-inn-mathura', 'BRIJWASI LAND INN - Mathura', 'Mathura', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Masani, Link Rd, Bypass, Mathura, Uttar Pradesh 281003', NULL, 'Located in Mathura, India, BRIJWASI LAND INN is part of the Galaxy Heritage World network of hotels and resorts. Find it at Masani, Link Rd, Bypass, Mathura, Uttar Pradesh 281003. Popular places to visit in Mathura include Shri Krishna Janmabhoomi, Dwarkadheesh Temple and Gita Mandir.', 'assets/images/hotels/brijwasi-land-inn-mathura/1.webp', 1),
(254, 'H584', 'the-lalita-grand', 'The Lalita Grand', 'Mathura', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Agra Rd, behind Brij Nursery, near Veterinary College, Aurangabad, Mathura, Uttar Pradesh 281001', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Lalita+Grand/@27.452004,77.7062634,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xcd388263826d17db?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjWtvanxJz7AhVNTmwGHQOVCvAQ_BJ6BAhlEAU', 'You\'re eligible for a Genius discount at LALITA GRAND! To save at this property, all you have to do is sign in.\n\nSet in Mathura, 39 km from Bharatpur Railway Station, LALITA GRAND offers accommodation with a restaurant, free private parking, a garden and a terrace. Among the facilities at this property are a concierge service and a tour desk, along with free WiFi throughout the property. The accommodation features a 24-hour front desk, room service and currency exchange for guests.\n\nThe units in the hotel are equipped with a kettle. All rooms are fitted with air conditioning and a flat-screen TV, and certain units at LALITA GRAND have a balcony.\n\nGuests at the accommodation can enjoy a continental or a buffet breakfast.\n\nAkbar\'s Tomb is 42 km from LALITA GRAND, while Mathura Railway Station is 6.8 km away. The nearest airport is Agra Airport, 53 km from the hotel.', 'assets/images/hotels/the-lalita-grand/1.webp', 1),
(255, 'H585', 'wingston-a-treehouse-hotel-mathura', 'Wingston A Treehouse Hotel - Mathura', 'Mathura', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels; treehouses', 'Masani Rd, Garravkendra, Mathura, Uttar Pradesh 281001', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Wingston+A+Treehouse+Hotel+-+Mathura/@27.5248788,77.6653952,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xfc4d033f4c10c78d?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiml9uPxpz7AhUUZ2wGHeh9Dw8Q_BJ6BAh2EAU', 'Mathura, the land hallowed by the aura of Shri Krishna, now offers you the most luxurious and modern comfort that your senses can imagine. Situated approximately 150 kms. Away from Delhi on the banks of the river Yamuna. Mathura abounds in places of religious and historic interest. All year round, a number of festivals and fairs dot the landscape; that makes it an ideal year long tourist an relaxation spot. Once in Mathura, you would like to surround yourself with luxurious settings with a touch of home; we have provided you with just that. A retreat that sticks to the purest quality in all round services; you will find yourself bowled over in the magnificent surroundings and the warmth of our personalize attention to your needs.', 'assets/images/hotels/wingston-a-treehouse-hotel-mathura/1.webp', 1),
