(260, 'H782', 'hotel-atlantic', 'Hotel Atlantic', 'Mumbai', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', '18 - B, Juhu Tara Rd, near Kishor Kumar\'s Bungalow, Shivaji Nagr, Juhu, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400049', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d15081.640017138416!2d72.8277663!3d19.089661!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7c9eadcb61bcf%3A0x23c5f613af07d854!2sHotel%20Atlantic!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1716049830861!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'Stay at Hotel Atlantic in Mumbai, India. The address is 18 - B, Juhu Tara Rd, near Kishor Kumar\'s Bungalow, Shivaji Nagr, Juhu, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400049. Popular places to visit in Mumbai include Gateway of India, Marine Drive and Elephanta Caves.', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-atlantic/1.webp', 1),
(261, 'H781', 'hotel-sea-princess', 'Hotel Sea Princess', 'Mumbai', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Juhu Tara Road, Beach, near Juhu, Juhu, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400049', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d15081.298446277287!2d72.8281295!3d19.0934102!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7b749b5d7d5d1%3A0x6cb9f769976f8426!2sHotel%20Sea%20Princess!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1716049527985!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'Set on Juhu beach, this upscale hotel in a modern, glass-fronted building is 5 km from Chhatrapati Shivaji International Airport and 10 km from Shree Siddhivinayak Ganapati Temple.\n\nFeaturing colourful accents and chic wood furnishings, the stylish rooms offer free Wi-Fi and flat-screen TVs, plus minibars, and tea and coffeemaking facilities. Suites add floor-to-ceiling windows, living rooms, balconies and ocean views.\n\nFree perks include parking, an airport shuttle and a breakfast buffet served in the sea-view 24-hour coffee shop. There\'s a chic restaurant, 2 bars and a buzzy nightclub, plus an outdoor pool, a spa and a fitness room.', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-sea-princess/1.webp', 1),
(262, 'H589', 'itc-grand-central-mumbai-leed-platinum-certified-luxury-hotel-parel', 'ITC Grand Central, Mumbai- LEED Platinum certified luxury hotel | Parel', 'Mumbai', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', '287, Dr Baba Saheb Ambedkar Rd, Parel East, Parel, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400012', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/ITC+Grand+Central,+Mumbai-+LEED+Platinum+certified+luxury+hotel+%7C+Parel/@18.9974103,72.8377951,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x5c5fb613a8b199d8?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiuydrmyZz7AhVqZWwGHTUVATMQ_BJ6BAhtEAU', 'Located in Parel Mumbai, a Grandeur, 5-star ITC Grand Central, A Luxury Collection Hotel in Mumbai features exquisite rooms and suites with city views.\n\nITC Grand Central, Mumbai features an partially indoor & outdoor swimming pool & children’s pool. Guests have access to a spa and wellness centre and can work-out at the hotel’s fitness centre. Modern conveniences include a currency exchange, salon and 24-hour reception.\n\nLarge windows and carpeted flooring are standard in the air-conditioned rooms and suites. A flat-screen satellite TV, work desk and seating area are provided. Private bathroom comes with a hot/cold shower, hairdryer and free toiletries. ITC Grand Central, Mumbai, A Luxury Collection is 2.3 Km from Dadar Bus Station, 4.4 Km Dadar Railway Station and 4.7 Km from the Mahalaxmi Racecourse. The Jehangir Art Gallery is 8.5 Km and the Gateway of India is 9.4 Km from the hotel while the Chhatrapati Shivaji International Airport is 17 km away.\n\nDining options include Kebabs and Kurries, Shanghai Club, Hornby’s Pavillion, Frederick\'s Lounge, Point of View Lounge & Fabelle the Chocolate Boutique. Guests can also enjoy drinks at Dublin- The Irish Bar.\n\nThe hotel has 3 Banquet venues.', 'assets/images/hotels/itc-grand-central-mumbai-leed-platinum-certified-luxury-hotel-parel/1.webp', 1),
(263, 'H587', 'radisson-blu-mumbai-international-airport', 'Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport', 'Mumbai', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Metro Station, Marol Maroshi Rd, near Marol, Bori Colony, Gamdevi, Marol, Andheri East, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400059', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Radisson+Blu+Mumbai+International+Airport/@19.1102222,72.8786221,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x8b9d421864a08a96?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjUlo3ix5z7AhVRR2wGHYcEBIwQ_BJ6BQiHARAF', 'Choose the Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport for an extraordinary stay in India’s financial capital. Located within 10 minutes of Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport Mumbai (BOM), our hotel places you near the city’s most important corporate hubs, including MIDC and the Bandra Kurla Complex (BKC).', 'assets/images/hotels/radisson-blu-mumbai-international-airport/1.webp', 1),
(264, 'H588', 'ramada-plaza-by-wyndham-palm-grove', 'Ramada Plaza by Wyndham Palm Grove', 'Mumbai', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Juhu Beach, Juhu Tara Rd, next to Shivaji Maharaj Statue, Nazir Wadi, Theosophical Housing Colony, Juhu, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400049', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ramada+Plaza+by+Wyndham+Palm+Grove/@19.0986902,72.8274864,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xd4dab35c6f29c4e1?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiK_P3kyJz7AhXGSmwGHTKKCwoQ_BJ6BQiGARAF', 'While selecting a Five Star hotel in Mumbai, every discerning business traveller and the leisure traveller on holiday in Mumbai looks for luxury, functionality and status, with value for money. At Ramada Plaza Palm Grove, one will experience all this and more.', 'assets/images/hotels/ramada-plaza-by-wyndham-palm-grove/1.webp', 1),
(265, 'H783', 'ramee-guestline-hotel-juhu', 'Ramee Guestline Hotel Juhu', 'Mumbai', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', '462, AB Nair Rd, Juhu Tara, Juhu, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400049', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d15079.857074161551!2d72.8255357!3d19.1092234!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7c9e99ac15329%3A0x41cda695343aae5!2sRamee%20Guestline%20Hotel%20Juhu!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1716050096004!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'Set in an area filled with shops, restaurants and bars, this informal hotel in a modern building is 3 minutes\' walk from Juhu Beach and 5 km from Chhatrapati Shivaji International Airport.\n\nRelaxed rooms provide complimentary Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs and minibars, plus tea and coffeemaking facilities. Suites add sofas. Room service is available 24/7.\n\nThere\'s a trendy Japanese restaurant, a rooftop cafe/bar and a nightclub (limited hours), as well as a contemporary eatery with a terrace. Other amenities include an outdoor pool and a fitness room. Spa treatments and valet parking can be arranged. Free Wi-Fi', 'assets/images/hotels/ramee-guestline-hotel-juhu/1.webp', 1),
(266, 'H709', 'royal-orchid-central-grazia-mumbai', 'Royal Orchid Central Grazia - Mumbai', 'Mumbai', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Plot No. 67, Palm Beach Road, Sector 19, Vashi, Near Truck Terminal, Navi Mumbai, Maharashtra 400705', NULL, 'Located in Mumbai, India, Royal Orchid Central Grazia is part of the Galaxy Heritage World network of hotels and resorts. Find it at Plot No. 67, Palm Beach Road, Sector 19, Vashi, Near Truck Terminal, Navi Mumbai, Maharashtra 400705. Popular places to visit in Mumbai include Gateway of India, Marine Drive and Elephanta Caves.', 'assets/images/hotels/royal-orchid-central-grazia-mumbai/1.webp', 1),
(267, 'H591', 'blanket-hotel-and-spa-luxury-5-star-resorts-in-munnar', 'Blanket Hotel & Spa | Luxury 5 Star Resorts in Munnar', 'Munnar', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Attukad Waterfalls, Aluva - Munnar Rd, Pallivasal, Kerala 685565', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Blanket+Hotel+%26+Spa+%7C+Luxury+5+Star+Resorts+in+Munnar/@10.051616,77.057221,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xe2dd95518617596?sa=X&hl=en&ved=2ahUKEwjUzITuzJz7AhWXTWwGHTZ-AkkQ_BJ6BAhmEAU', 'Blanket Hotel and Spa is a five star luxury hotel located at Attukad in Munnar. Perched on a hill with a panoramic view of the mystical Attukad Falls, the hotel is a perfect blend of luxury and nature’s melodious harmony. We offer five star service and luxury that is personalized to meet the most discerning needs our guests may have.', 'assets/images/hotels/blanket-hotel-and-spa-luxury-5-star-resorts-in-munnar/1.webp', 1),
(268, 'H593', 'elixir-hills-suites-resort-and-spa', 'Elixir Hills - Suites Resort and Spa', 'Munnar', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Near Letchmi Tea Estate, Munnar, Kerala 685612', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Elixir+Hills+-+Suites+Resort+and+Spa/@10.0615536,76.9884133,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x653b35ee8dd7c034?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwj55ra_zpz7AhUkTGwGHS0jCuIQ_BJ6BAhzEAU', 'Elixir Hills is an excellent choice for travellers visiting Munnar, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.\n\nGiven the close proximity to Kerala Farm (3.0 mi), guests of Elixir Hills can easily experience one of Munnar\'s most popular landmarks.\n\nFree wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Elixir Hills offer a flat screen TV, a kitchenette, and a minibar.\n\nDuring your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service. Guests of Elixir Hills are also welcome to enjoy a pool and free breakfast, located on site. For travellers arriving by car, free parking is available.\n\nThere is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular parks such as Blossom Hydel Park.\n\nEnjoy your stay in Munnar!', 'assets/images/hotels/elixir-hills-suites-resort-and-spa/1.webp', 1),
(269, 'H592', 'maxi-munnar-t-and-u-leisure-hotel', 'Maxi Munnar T&U Leisure Hotel', 'Munnar', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'MaxiMunnar Pvt Ltd, Road, Mattupetty, Munnar, Kerala 685612', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Maximunnar+T+%26+U+Leisure+Hotel/@10.0861722,77.0736449,15z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x0:0x95076e2cc39a6fa!5m2!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d10.086172!4d77.0736449', 'Stay at the best 4-star hotel in Munnar and enjoy its exceptional facilities\n\nSituated strategically at Mattupety Road, Munnar, T and U Leisure Hotel is a 4-star hotel. It is situated around 300 metres from Flower Garden, 600 metres from Madupatty Tea Estate, and 1 km from Lord Muruga Temple. Surrounded by lush greenery and hills, T and U Leisure Hotel has an in-house multi-cuisine restaurant that features an indoor and outdoor dining area with the view of the landscape.\n\nThe hotel is equipped with a health club and a spa. It also has a business centre. There is a recreation centre and the hotel arranges various adventure activities like trekking. Free Wi-Fi is available for the convenience of guests.\n\nThe property has 30 rooms. Patrons have a choice of 3 types of rooms: Deluxe Room, Suite, and Honeymoon Suite. The rooms are equipped with a television, tea/coffee maker, minibar, electronic safe, and Wi-Fi. The in-room services offered for the guests here include daily newspaper, room service, laundry, and in room dining.\n\nT and U Leisure Hotel have an in-house restaurant famous for its authentic Kerala, Indian and continental delicacies.\n\nThe Cochin International Airport is at a distance of 108 km from the property. The Udumalaippettai Railway Station is 88 km away. The Munnar Bus Stand is 4 km away from here.\n\nFlower Garden is situated 300 metres from the property. Lord Muruga Temple is about 1 km away, Munnar Tea Town is 1 km away, Munnar Water Falls is at a distance of 1.5 km from the property, CSI Church is 1.5 km away, and Mattupetty Dam is 9 km away from here.', 'assets/images/hotels/maxi-munnar-t-and-u-leisure-hotel/1.webp', 1),
(270, 'H715', 'pleasant-hill-resort-munnar', 'Pleasant Hill Resort - Munnar', 'Munnar', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'INTERNAL', 'resorts', 'Plane Para View Point, Kanthippara Road, Arivilamchal PO. Rajakkad, Munnar, Kerala 685619', NULL, 'Stay at Pleasant Hill Resort in Munnar, India. The address is Plane Para View Point, Kanthippara Road, Arivilamchal PO. Rajakkad, Munnar, Kerala 685619. Popular places to visit in Munnar include Eravikulam National Park, Mattupetty Dam and Anamudi Peak.', 'assets/images/hotels/pleasant-hill-resort-munnar/1.webp', 1),
(271, 'H714', 'the-munnar-queen-resort-munnar', 'The Munnar Queen Resort - Munnar', 'Munnar', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'INTERNAL', 'resorts', 'Chithirapuram South, Anachal Road Chithirapuram, Munnar, Kerala 685565', NULL, 'Stay at The Munnar Queen Resort in Munnar, India. The address is Chithirapuram South, Anachal Road Chithirapuram, Munnar, Kerala 685565. Popular places to visit in Munnar include Eravikulam National Park, Mattupetty Dam and Anamudi Peak.', 'assets/images/hotels/the-munnar-queen-resort-munnar/1.webp', 1),
(272, 'H595', 'fortune-resort-grace-mussoorie-uttarakhand', 'Fortune Resort Grace Mussoorie, Uttarakhand', 'Mussoorie', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts', 'Library Bazaar, Gandhi Chowk, Mussoorie, Uttarakhand 248179', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Fortune+Resort+Grace+Mussoorie,+Uttarakhand/@30.459032,78.0632697,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x8a6f0589abf17f58?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjkh53byqH7AhVuSmwGHfMWDuoQ_BJ6BAh_EAU', 'Fortune Resort Grace is an excellent choice for travellers visiting Mussoorie, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.\n\nFor those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Mussoorie, Fortune Resort Grace is located a short distance from The Camel Rock (0.8 mi) and St. Paul\'s Church, Landour (1.9 mi).\n\nFree wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Fortune Resort Grace offer a flat screen TV, a minibar, and air conditioning.\n\nDuring your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a concierge and room service. Guests of Fortune Resort Grace are also welcome to enjoy a fitness center and free breakfast, located on site. For travellers arriving by car, free parking is available.\n\nWhen you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Kalsang, Cafe Ivy, and JW Cafe, which are some Asian restaurants that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.\n\nIf you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Cloud\'s End (0.9 mi), Company Garden (0.6 mi), or Shedup Choepelling Temple (1.2 mi), which are popular attractions amongst tourists, and they are all within walking distance.\n\nEnjoy your stay in Mussoorie!', 'assets/images/hotels/fortune-resort-grace-mussoorie-uttarakhand/1.webp', 1),
(273, 'H298', 'honeymoon-in-mussoorie', 'HONEYMOON IN MUSSOORIE', 'Mussoorie', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d13756.749305433119!2d78.0719627!3d30.4591318!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x3d5cc4623ba62fd2!2sHoneymoon%20Inn!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1631076952739!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'Romantic Honeymoon Inn Mussoorie is located in the very heart of Mussoorie, a hill station in the Garhwal Himalayas. All its 20 rooms provide stunning views over the awe-inspiring Doon Valley. En-suite deluxe rooms provide a queen-size bed, an LCD television and tea/coffee making facilities. Super deluxe Rooms instead feature a king-size bed while family suites offer two queen-size beds. The honeymoon special room has a sumptuous round bed with a lace canopy. Honeymoon Inn Mussoorie provides a games console, air hockey and other games to help keep families entertained. There are also on-site parking spaces for guests with a vehicle and Wi-Fi access is free. The hotel’s restaurant serves tasty Indian favourites such as Chicken Biryani and Vegetable Pulao alongside pasta dishes and Chinese meals. Room service is also available. Two miles away, the Soham Heritage & Art Centre showcases local Indian culture and a three-mile hike, Lal Tibba is one of the area’s highest points providing amazing panoramic views.', 'assets/images/hotels/honeymoon-in-mussoorie/1.webp', 1),
(274, 'H716', 'honeymoon-inn-mussoorie', 'HONEYMOON INN - Mussoorie', 'Mussoorie', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'The Mall Rd, The Mall Road, Mussoorie, Uttarakhand 248179', NULL, 'Stay at HONEYMOON INN, a hotel in Mussoorie, India. The address is The Mall Rd, The Mall Road, Mussoorie, Uttarakhand 248179. Popular places to visit in Mussoorie include Kempty Falls, Lal Tibba and Gun Hill.', 'assets/images/hotels/honeymoon-inn-mussoorie/1.webp', 1),
