(281, 'H597', 'country-inn-and-suites-by-radisson-mysore', 'Country Inn & Suites by Radisson, Mysore', 'Mysore', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', '345/A, near Infosys Campus, Hebbal Industrial Estate, Hebbal Industrial Area, Mysuru, Karnataka 570016', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Country+Inn+%26+Suites+by+Radisson,+Mysore/@12.3629704,76.6062436,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x2c15ecbcba1372b8?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjI-46HzaH7AhWHR2wGHRneDFAQ_BJ6BAh7EAU', 'The Country Inn & Suites® by Radisson, Mysore offers a modern retreat near major attractions like the Brindavan Gardens. Only 15 minutes from Mandakalli Airport (MYQ) and three minutes from National Highway 275, our hotel offers easy access for traveling families. During your stay, be sure to take the kids to see downtown sights like Mysore Palace and Mysuru Zoo. Are you in town for work? Utilize our business center to plan an outdoor reception for your colleagues. When you aren’t out and about, treat yourself to a delightful day by our outdoor pool. After an invigorating swim, you can exercise in the well-equipped fitness center to keep up your workout routine. If you’re too tired for a sit-down dinner at one of the on-site restaurants, take advantage of our 24-hour room service, and stop by PB&G for poolside drinks later. To show our commitment to maintaining a family-friendly atmosphere, we also provide a kids’ play area, a children’s pool and an on-call doctor. As we continue to follow the latest advice and recommendations from the World Health Organization (WHO) and local authorities as part of our global response to the COVID-19 pandemic, we would like to inform you that following services are available during your stay: 1)Room 2)Room Service 3)Mosaic -a la carte and soft beverages would be served 4)PBNG-a la carte and soft beverages would be served 5)Laundry Liquor will not be served till further notice .', 'assets/images/hotels/country-inn-and-suites-by-radisson-mysore/1.webp', 1),
(282, 'H599', 'emerald-clarks-inn-suites', 'Emerald Clarks Inn Suites', 'Mysore', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', '37, Link Main Rd, Industrial suburb, 3rd phase, Vidyaranyapura, Visveshwara Nagar, Karnataka 570008', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Emerald+Clarks+Inn+Suites/@12.2680711,76.6444052,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xd7c8c7ac593a0760?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjFoeTez6H7AhV8TGwGHX91DF8Q_BJ6BAh_EAU', 'Clarks Inn group is proud to present Emerald Clarks Inn suites in Mysuru, one of the finest hotels in Mysuru city, the city of palaces. Emerald Clarks Inn Suites is situated in a calm and serene environment conveniently located at a distance of 5 kms from both the Royal Mysuru palace and the Mysuru Airport making it an ideal destination for both business and leisure travelers. The hotel also provides breathtaking views of the holistic Chamundi hills. Emerald Clarks Inn suites is a luxurious hotel with 44 rooms in different categories to suit everyone’s needs. All of our guest rooms are designed to ensure that our customers revel in the lap of luxury and experience pure bliss. The hotel also has 3 banquets, a conference room and a board room to ensure that every event turns out to be a beautiful memory. Be it a corporate conference, a lavish reception or a surprise birthday party, we at Emerald Clarks Inn will leave no stone unturned to make your event truly memorable. Sattvik by Emerald Clarks Inn is a pure vegetarian delight restaurant bringing you the finest South Indian, North Indian, Chinese and continental delicacies along with the traditional local flavours to savour your taste buds. Among the endless list of facilities provided by Emerald Clarks Inn Suites, the hotel also has a well equipped gym, spa and Illusion rooftop lounge bar which will be opening soon.', 'assets/images/hotels/emerald-clarks-inn-suites/1.webp', 1),
(283, 'H598', 'hotel-sandesh-the-prince', 'Hotel Sandesh The Prince', 'Mysore', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'No 3 Nethra Nivas, Nazarbad Main Rd, Mysuru, Karnataka 570010', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hotel+Sandesh+The+Prince/@12.3092408,76.6623608,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x3539b15d7b17e92f', 'Sandesh The Prince- World Class Luxurious Four Star Hotel in Mysore, and its location is as distinctive as its Design and Interior. Conveniently situated in Heart of historic City of Mysore. The Hotel will prove to the travelers that, the best place to stay in Mysore is not in a Palace. With its majestic palaces, magnificent gardens & ancient temples, it\'s no wonder that Mysore has gained great eminence as a princely city. Combining tradition with modern opulence - Sandesh The Prince is reminiscent of the city\'s bygone era. Hotel Has 108 luxurious rooms, each with it\'s unique view. We have Executive Rooms, Premier Rooms, Executive Suites & Premier Suites, Multi Cuisine Restaurant called The Castle, Sizzler The Pool side barbeque Restaurant, Sandy\'s 24/7 Cafe, Khedda Bar, The Road Pub, A Out door Pool, Gaming zone for Kids, Health Club, Salon & Spa', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-sandesh-the-prince/1.webp', 1),
(284, 'H708', 'hotel-sandesh-the-prince-mysore', 'Hotel Sandesh The Prince - Mysore', 'Mysore', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'No 3 Nethra Nivas, Nazarbad Main Rd, Mysuru, Karnataka 570010', NULL, 'Stay at Hotel Sandesh The Prince in Mysore, India. The address is No 3 Nethra Nivas, Nazarbad Main Rd, Mysuru, Karnataka 570010. Popular places to visit in Mysore include Mysore Palace, Brindavan Gardens and Chamundi Hill.', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-sandesh-the-prince-mysore/1.webp', 1),
(285, 'H601', 'hotel-nagpur-ashok', 'Hotel Nagpur Ashok', 'Nagpur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'West High Court Road, Aath Rasta Chowk, Laxminagar, Nagpur, Maharashtra 440022', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hotel+Nagpur+Ashok/@21.123385,79.064515,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xe1ff7f6028251a43?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwj-_Z3pjKT7AhWvUWwGHZp1BicQ_BJ6BAh_EAU', 'Hotel The Nagpur Ashok, a 3 star hotel at Nagpur is just 3.8Km drive from the airport((Latitude - 21.12343 & Longitude 79.06455) And 4km from railway station and is within close proximity to major business areas', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-nagpur-ashok/1.webp', 1),
(286, 'H602', 'radisson-blu-hotel-nagpur', 'Radisson Blu Hotel Nagpur', 'Nagpur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', '7, Wardha Rd, Samarth Nagar East, Nagpur, Maharashtra 440015', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Radisson+Blu+Hotel+Nagpur/@21.1059361,79.0696657,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x2bd11894402740fb?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjfiO2hj6T7AhUzTmwGHZF_BfYQ_BJ6BQiMARAF', 'Radisson Blu Hotel Nagpur is an elegantly designed contemporary business hotel, fashioned by the world renovated interior designed and equipped with the state of the art technology, each of the room is stylish and comfortable. These rooms and suites provide our guest with all possible comforts. The Radisson Blu Hotel Nagpur provides a comprehensive range of facilities and amenities that will appeal not only to discerning business guests but also leisure travellers seeking a comfortable stay. To ensure that each guest has a relaxing, stress-free visit, our hotel\'s facility in Nagpur offers quality services and amenities, including a Business Centre, Fitness Centre with state-of-the-art equipment, swimming pool, a variety of spa therapies, hair and beauty treatments, fabulous on-site dining options and the exclusive Business Class Lounge.', 'assets/images/hotels/radisson-blu-hotel-nagpur/1.webp', 1),
(287, 'H770', 'hotel-aroma-nanital', 'Hotel Aroma Nanital', 'Nainital', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Ayarpatta Slopes, Mallital, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263002', '-', 'Hotel Aroma Nanital is located in Nainital, India. Its address is Ayarpatta Slopes, Mallital, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263002. Popular places to visit in Nainital include Naini Lake, Snow View Point and Tiffin Top.', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-aroma-nanital/1.webp', 1),
(288, 'H704', 'hotel-limewood-nainital', 'HOTEL LIMEWOOD - Nainital', 'Nainital', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Hotel, Armadale compound, Jahangirabad Palace Near Shervani, Mallital, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263002', NULL, 'HOTEL LIMEWOOD is located in Nainital, India. Its address is Hotel, Armadale compound, Jahangirabad Palace Near Shervani, Mallital, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263002. Popular places to visit in Nainital include Naini Lake, Snow View Point and Tiffin Top.', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-limewood-nainital/1.webp', 1),
(289, 'H705', 'langdale-manor-nainital', 'LANGDALE MANOR - Nainital', 'Nainital', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Hill, Langdale Estate, Ayarpatta, Mallital, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263001', NULL, 'Stay at LANGDALE MANOR, a hotel in Nainital, India. The address is Hill, Langdale Estate, Ayarpatta, Mallital, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263001. Popular places to visit in Nainital include Naini Lake, Snow View Point and Tiffin Top.', 'assets/images/hotels/langdale-manor-nainital/1.webp', 1),
(290, 'H771', 'the-palace-belvedere', 'The Palace Belvedere', 'Nainital', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels; heritage-homes; castles', 'Awagarh Estate, Mallital, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263001', '-', 'Located in Nainital, India, The Palace Belvedere is part of the Galaxy Heritage World network of hotels and resorts. Find it at Awagarh Estate, Mallital, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263001. Popular places to visit in Nainital include Naini Lake, Snow View Point and Tiffin Top.', 'assets/images/hotels/the-palace-belvedere/1.webp', 1),
(291, 'H703', 'vikram-vintage-nainital', 'Vikram Vintage - Nainital', 'Nainital', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Mallital, near Chamber\'s High Court, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263001', NULL, 'Vikram Vintage is a hotel in Nainital, India. Its address is Mallital, near Chamber\'s High Court, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263001. Popular places to visit in Nainital include Naini Lake, Snow View Point and Tiffin Top.', 'assets/images/hotels/vikram-vintage-nainital/1.webp', 1),
(292, 'H517', 'hotel-pleasure-home', 'Hotel Pleasure Home', 'Nepal', 'Nepal', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels; vacation-homes', 'Thamel, Kathmandu 44600, Nepal', 'https://www.google.com/maps?hl=en-GB&gl=IN&um=1&ie=UTF-8&fb=1&sa=X&geocode=KVMw3g79GOs5MTUmZziYu0zS&daddr=Hotel+Pleasure+Home,+Thamel,+Kathmandu+44600,+Nepal', 'Friendly, Hotel in the very heart of Thamel District of Kathmandu. We offer 31 spacious rooms, with private bath and showers that feature 24 hours hot water, making us one of the few hotels in Thamel to offer such a service. Beautiful roof gardens for relaxant. Room service is available. The Hotel Pleasure Home makes the ideal location to work from for all of your sightseeing in the Kathmandu Valley. Free wi-fi in all the rooms. Air-Conditioned rooms available. We have in our rooms from single beds to our luxurious king-size beds. All rooms come with view. Uniquely decorated in Tibetan theme, courtesy of Tibetan refugees who initially built our guest house. Enjoy our spa and business center as well as satellite TV in all of the rooms. Clean and comfortable. You\'ll sleep well here', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-pleasure-home/1.webp', 1),
(293, 'H518', 'hotel-pomelo-house-inn', 'Hotel Pomelo House Inn', 'Nepal', 'Nepal', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Indrayani Galli, Kathmandu 44600, Nepal', 'https://www.google.com/maps?hl=en-GB&gl=IN&um=1&ie=UTF-8&fb=1&sa=X&geocode=KRnOk8H7GOs5MUUksMAaMtUI&daddr=Hotel+Pomelo+House+Inn,+Indrayani+Galli,+Kathmandu+44600,+Nepal', 'Pomelo House is located in the Thamel area within walking distance of Hanuman Dhoka and Durbar Square. We have two buildings that are 2 minutes walk from each other. We offer you a large selection of suites according to your wish: a shared hostel, single, double and triple rooms, also family rooms. Hotel Pomelo House boasts an outdoor dining area, rooftop terrace and views of the garden. Guests can enjoy the on-site restaurant and room service. Pomelo house hotel offers access to a vast array of services, including daily housekeeping, taxi service, 24-hour front desk, facilities for disabled guests and free Wi-Fi in all rooms. For your comfort, we propose complimentary instant coffee, complimentary tea, dressing room with mirror to help guests recharge after a long day. We also offer a variety of recreational facilities, including hiking trails, yoga room. Bike hire and car hire are available at our hotel. When you are looking for comfortable and convenient accommodations in Kathmandu, make Hotel Pomelo House your home away from home', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-pomelo-house-inn/1.webp', 1),
(294, 'H516', 'vivanta-kathmandu', 'Vivanta Kathmandu', 'Nepal', 'Nepal', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Jhamsikhel Road 03, Lalitpur 44600, Nepal', 'https://www.google.com/maps?hl=en-GB&gl=IN&um=1&ie=UTF-8&fb=1&sa=X&geocode=Kf3jtyMHGes5MUwmbHcEpzgW&daddr=Vivanta+Kathmandu,+Jhamsikhel+Road+03,+Lalitpur+44600,+Nepal', 'Vivanta Kathmandu features a full-service spa and a heated infinity pool. Dining is available at one of the hotel\'s 2 restaurants. A rooftop bar/lounge is on site where guests can unwind with a drink. Complimentary wireless Internet access is available in public areas. A business center is on site at this 4-star property. This luxury hotel also offers concierge and laundry services', 'assets/images/hotels/vivanta-kathmandu/1.webp', 1),
(295, 'H605', 'club-mahindra-resort-derby-green-ooty-tamil-nadu', 'Club Mahindra Resort - Derby Green, Ooty, Tamil Nadu', 'Ooty', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'ASSOCIATED', 'resorts', '29-49, Baikey Road, Off Ettines Road, Near Ooty Race Course, Ooty, Tamil Nadu 643001', 'google.com/maps/place/Club+Mahindra+Resort+-+Derby+Green,+Ooty,+Tamil+Nadu/@11.4015456,76.6967547,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xb24e30ade98da2a3?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwj40Z3yk6T7AhVwSWwGHTewBMgQ_BJ6BQiHARAF', 'Finding an ideal luxury resort in Ooty (Udhagamandalam) does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Club Mahindra Derby Green, a nice option for travellers like you.\n\nClose to some of Ooty (Udhagamandalam)\'s most popular landmarks, such as Western Catchment (0.2 mi) and CSI St Thomas Church (0.2 mi), Club Mahindra Derby Green is a great destination for tourists.\n\nThe rooms offer a flat screen TV, a kitchenette, and blackout curtains, and getting online is possible, as internet access is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.\n\nClub Mahindra Derby Green features 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service. In addition, as a valued Club Mahindra Derby Green guest, you can enjoy a fitness center and breakfast that are available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.\n\nIf you like Chinese restaurants, Club Mahindra Derby Green is conveniently located near Earl\'s Secret, Hyderabad Biryani House, and Ascot Multi Cuisine Restaurant at Ooty.\n\nIf you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Rose Garden (0.8 mi), Murugan Temple (0.7 mi), or St. Stephen\'s Church (1.0 mi), which are popular attractions amongst tourists, and they are all within walking distance.\n\nClub Mahindra Derby Green looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Ooty (Udhagamandalam).', 'assets/images/hotels/club-mahindra-resort-derby-green-ooty-tamil-nadu/1.webp', 1),
(296, 'H603', 'sterling-ooty-fern-hill', 'Sterling Ooty - Fern Hill', 'Ooty', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', '#73, Kundah House Road, Fern Hill, Ooty, Tamil Nadu 643004', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Sterling+Ooty+-+Fern+Hill/@11.3904313,76.698605,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xe4b76896a9ff16eb?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiEy5PIkKT7AhWvSGwGHdWCCv0Q_BJ6BQiBARAF', 'Perched at one of the highest points in Ooty, this resort has an amazing view of the Nilgiris. Sterling Ooty Fern Hill is set in an alluring scenic location, surrounded on all sides by the ethereal beauty of the Nilgiri Hills. The resort’s sloping roofs and terracotta tiles are reminiscent of the quaint charm of a bygone era. With a heady mix of comfort and tranquility, spending time within the resort is as attractive an option as venturing into the idyllic mountainside.', 'assets/images/hotels/sterling-ooty-fern-hill/1.webp', 1),
(297, 'H604', 'welcomheritage-fernhills-royal-palace', 'WelcomHeritage Fernhills Royal Palace', 'Ooty', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels; heritage-homes; castles', 'Ferrnhills Post, Ooty, Tamil Nadu 643004', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/WelcomHeritage+Fernhills+Royal+Palace/@11.3970615,76.6857594,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x155300f78b447bd2?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwj344WAk6T7AhVtTmwGHSrtDoAQ_BJ6BQiBARAF', 'Fernhills Palace is the summer palace of the Mysore Maharajas. It was built in 1844 by Capt. F. Cotton. It changed several hands as the time went by till mid-1860s, when it was temporarily named Moonesami and served as one of the Ooty\'s earliest club hotels. The year was 1873 when Ferrnhills Palace found a new royal owner. His Highness Chamarajendra Wadiyar X is the first Indian royal to buy an English holding in Ooty. Since then Ferrnhills Royale Palace has been with the Wadiyar dynasty and today it continues in the capable hands of His Highness Srikanta Datta Narasimharaja Wadiyar. The palace is superbly finished with Burmese teak, features a magnificent ballroom with a highly valued ornamental papier-mache ceiling.', 'assets/images/hotels/welcomheritage-fernhills-royal-palace/1.webp', 1),
(298, 'PCG01', 'dreamland-hotel', 'Dreamland Hotel', 'Panchgani', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Dreamland Hotel, Main Road, Panchgani, India', 'https://maps.google.com/?q=Dreamland%20Hotel%20Panchgani', 'Experience luxury hospitality at Dreamland Hotel in Panchgani, featuring modern amenities and exceptional service.', NULL, 1),
