(382, 'H273', 'aaram-mahal-udaipur', 'AARAM MAHAL UDAIPUR', 'Udaipur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels; heritage-homes', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d14513.74657657296!2d73.6864477!3d24.5741227!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x9602a28e8770acfd!2sAaram%20Mahal!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1630392648593!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'Located in Udaipur, 200 m from Lake Pichola, Aaram Mahal by Pachar Group provides accommodation with a restaurant, free private parking, a bar and a terrace. Among the facilities at this property are a 24-hour front desk and room service, along with free WiFi throughout the property. The hotel features family rooms. At the hotel, every room is equipped with a desk, a flat-screen TV and a private bathroom. All units at Aaram Mahal by Pachar Group include air conditioning and a wardrobe. A continental breakfast is available daily at the accommodation. Popular points of interest near Aaram Mahal by Pachar Group include City Palace of Udaipur, Jagdish temple and Bagore ki Haveli. The nearest airport is Maharana Pratap Airport, 24 km from the hotel. Couples particularly like the location — they rated it 8.0 for a two-person trip. We speak your language! “Aaram Mahal was a good choice from Check-in to Check-Out. Yash at the reception was warm and caring to look after our needs e.g. supplying us an extra bed with reasonable charges. The tea and snacks were great at reasonable rates. Our two days stay elderly parents and two toddlers was a great and safe stay. The location is close by to Lake Pichhola Boating point, Bada Bazaar and other amenities. I highly recommend Aaram Mahal for family.', 'assets/images/hotels/aaram-mahal-udaipur/1.webp', 1),
(383, 'H685', 'bhairavgarh-resort-and-spa-udaipur', 'Bhairavgarh Resort and Spa - Udaipur', 'Udaipur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'RESORT', 'INTERNAL', 'resorts; wellness-retreats', 'Maharana Pratap Khel Gaon, 200 ft Road, Opposite R.T.O Chitrakoot Nagar, Bhuwana, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313001', NULL, 'Stay at Bhairavgarh Resort and Spa in Udaipur, India. The address is Maharana Pratap Khel Gaon, 200 ft Road, Opposite R.T.O Chitrakoot Nagar, Bhuwana, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313001. Popular places to visit in Udaipur include City Palace, Lake Pichola and Jagmandir.', 'assets/images/hotels/bhairavgarh-resort-and-spa-udaipur/1.webp', 1),
(384, 'H476', 'q-hotel-udaipur', 'Q Hotel Udaipur', 'Udaipur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', '2-A, New Flora Complex, Near New Pula Bridge, Fatehpura Near Celebration Mall, Road, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313001', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Q+Hotel+Udaipur/@24.608999,73.694733,15z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x0:0x2c665e2ec38217f2!5m2!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d24.608999!4d73.694733', 'Featuring a 24-hour front desk, Q Hotel Udaipur is located just 2 km from Fateh Sagar Lake. The property also offers an outdoor swimming pool and access facilities for the physically challenged.', 'assets/images/hotels/q-hotel-udaipur/1.webp', 1),
(385, 'H337', 'regenta-central-mewargarh', 'Regenta Central Mewargarh', 'Udaipur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d14512.219237652116!2d73.6561129!3d24.5873046!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0xeb93fb40ae23729b!2sRegenta%20Central%20Mewargarh!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1632034355821!5m2!1sen!2sin', 'Set in a whitewashed, palatial building, this unpretentious hotel is 4 km from City Palace and 5 km from boat rides on Lake Pichola.\n\nCasual rooms provide free Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs and safes, plus tea and coffeemaking facilities. Upgraded rooms add lake views and minibars. Suites have separate sitting and dining areas. Room service is available 24/7.\n\nBreakfast is complimentary. There\'s a buffet-style restaurant in a grand hall, and a rooftop restaurant. Other amenities include an outdoor pool, a spa and a business centre.', 'assets/images/hotels/regenta-central-mewargarh/1.webp', 1),
(386, 'H686', 'regenta-central-mewargarh-udaipur', 'Regenta Central Mewargarh - Udaipur', 'Udaipur', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Sajjan Garh Rd, near Biological Park, Eklavya Colony, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313001', NULL, 'Stay at Regenta Central Mewargarh, a hotel in Udaipur, India. The address is Sajjan Garh Rd, near Biological Park, Eklavya Colony, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313001. Popular places to visit in Udaipur include City Palace, Lake Pichola and Jagmandir.', 'assets/images/hotels/regenta-central-mewargarh-udaipur/1.webp', 1),
