(390, 'H673', 'royal-orchid-central-vadodara', 'Royal Orchid Central - Vadodara', 'Vadodara', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Mujmahuda Rd, Pratham Avenue, Akota, Vadodara, Gujarat 390020', NULL, 'Royal Orchid Central is a hotel in Vadodara, India. Its address is Mujmahuda Rd, Pratham Avenue, Akota, Vadodara, Gujarat 390020. Popular places to visit in Vadodara include Laxmi Vilas Palace, Sayaji Baug and Maharaja Fateh Singh Museum.', 'assets/images/hotels/royal-orchid-central-vadodara/1.webp', 1),
