(393, 'H611', 'hotel-maurya', 'Hotel Maurya', 'Visakhapatnam', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Fraser Rd, South Gandhi Maidan, Raja Ji Salai, Dujra Diara, Patna, Bihar 800001', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hotel+Maurya/@25.6156899,85.1422434,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xa5e87a1f3059ceb5?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwixms-H1rD7AhW-_HMBHa1MDjcQ_BJ6BAh8EAc', 'Located in the heart of Patna adjacent to the city’s famous landmark Gandhi Maidan, Hotel Maurya Patna offers easy access to business districts, government offices and leisure attractions. A convenient 20-minutes drive from the airport or 10-minutes from the railway station will reach you at the destination. And once here, Maurya, a legacy hotel of over forty years, will welcome you with warm hospitality as well as an assurance that your stay in Patna is comfortable and memorable.', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-maurya/1.webp', 1),
(394, 'H610', 'hotel-patliputra-continental', 'HOTEL PATLIPUTRA CONTINENTAL', 'Visakhapatnam', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'PC Bypass Road, Golamber, Anisabad, Patna, Bihar 800002', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/HOTEL+PATLIPUTRA+CONTINENTAL/@25.585525,85.0961823,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xbe75aff7e613d0ad?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjb6KzI1LD7AhUYHbcAHTSBAv4Q_BJ6BQiMARAI', 'Five star deluxe and luxury hotel in Patna . 5 minutes away from the airport and 10 minutes from railway station with exceptional amenities like gym, spa & saloon, rooftop swimming pool, game zone, 2 restaurants with 24x7 coffee shop.', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-patliputra-continental/1.webp', 1),
(395, 'H609', 'lemon-tree-premier-patna', 'Lemon Tree Premier, Patna', 'Visakhapatnam', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Plot no, 876, Exhibition Rd, near Gandhi Maidan Road, South Gandhi Maidan, Raja Ji Salai, Dujra Diara, Patna, Bihar 800001', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Lemon+Tree+Premier,+Patna/@25.6144797,85.1437947,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x3c3871ad3cf02a8d?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiOsYOag677AhXF63MBHR4OCS4Q_BJ6BAh-EAc', 'Situated in the heart of the business and entertainment hub of the city, Lemon Tree Premier, Patna is located on Exhibition Road, just 5 minutes’ walk from the historic Gandhi Maidan.The hotel also offers over 20,000 sq.ft of banquet spaces including 4 large conference rooms, an exquisite board room, a business center along with a rooftop outdoor terrace.', 'assets/images/hotels/lemon-tree-premier-patna/1.webp', 1),
(396, 'H641', 'novotel-visakhapatnam-varun-beach', 'Novotel Visakhapatnam Varun Beach', 'Visakhapatnam', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Dr NTR Beach Rd, Krishna Nagar, Maharani Peta, Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh 530002', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/Novotel+Visakhapatnam+Varun+Beach/@17.7107745,83.3160397,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xe0af48edae5bd5ea?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwii_cWU-bf7AhUB8HMBHerKDEYQ_BJ6BQiFARAH', 'Placed right on the beach stands a model of architectural brilliance and an epitome of hospitality, Novotel Visakhapatnam Varun Beach, the first and only 5-star deluxe hotel of the city and the entire state of Andhra Pradesh. With major accolades of the hospitality world added to its name like the "Best New Hotel of the Year 2011", "Best Hotel Design in Project Stage -PAN India 2011", "Best Business Hotel in Visakhapatnam" etc., Novotel Visakhapatnam Varun Beach is the golden pendant on the diamond necklace, i.E., The VUDA marine drive. Be it a wedding/conference/exhibition, our banquet halls spread over 56000 sft, are crafted beautifully to give you the best of facilities and ambience. NVVB holds the credential of having the largest pillar-less banquet hall by any hotel in the state, called the V-Convention, which can accommodate up to 1250 guests. The whole banquet area of the hotel can be adjusted into 12 banquet halls, each to its own speciality. The Gen-Next Eureka room with customized modular furniture for power meetings has become the most sought after meeting venue in and around the city. With a dedicated entry to these banquets, they are spaced out to hold gatherings as much as 4000 there by making them one of, in the entire state. Our dining solutions have left our guests drooling from day one. The signature Square restaurant is an all Day Dining/Contemporary Interactive Buffet restaurant. Over-looking the Land-scaped pool gardens and the Bay of Bengal, the Square has the largest buffet spread in the city. Cantilevered design, live stations and cooking counters, and elegant wine display will make you want to come back for more. Zaffran, the Specialty Indian restaurant set by the pool and landscaped lawns overlooking the ocean, prides itself on serving the best and most authentic Indian food in the city. The restaurant also includes 2 private dining rooms each accommodating 10 guests. The roof-top Infinity bar and kitchen placed 150ft above the sea level serves delicious multi-cuisine food. A panoramic aerial-like view of the Bay of Bengal is its USP apart from the scrumptious delicacies. The in-house guests are lodged in a vast abode of 225 rooms, all with a breathtaking sea-facing view. Superior Rooms and Premier Rooms are at your service for short leisure and business trips. Our Extended Stay Rooms have been home for many people including leading MNC personnel. The Executive Suites will pad you with all the comforts you can think of and for those who want nothing less than king-size, make the Presidential Suite your dwelling. We also hold the unique asset of an accessible room for differently-enabled people which is customized beautifully to help them feel at home. All our guests, be it in-house or otherwise, have an access to a variety of fitness and leisure options. The State-of-the-art 24 hours fitness centre, In Balance also offers access to a unique landscaped terrace jogging track and 24 hours outdoor infinity pool which are also the first in the state. The Dew, beauty salon and spa offers the most relaxing and rejuvenating solution in the city. The happening parties of the town are hosted at our Vue Bar and Infinity Lounge, which are known to be home for all the party animals of the city. Altogether, the hotel is reputed in delivering the fantastic 5-star deluxe experience time and again and is not to be missed.', 'assets/images/hotels/novotel-visakhapatnam-varun-beach/1.webp', 1),
(397, 'H642', 'the-gateway-hotel-beach-road-visakhapatnam', 'The Gateway Hotel Beach Road Visakhapatnam', 'Visakhapatnam', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Dr NTR Beach Rd, Pandurangapuram, Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh 530002', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Gateway+Hotel+Beach+Road+Visakhapatnam/@17.7114286,83.3163937,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x1b82781de177efff?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwih0v6A-rf7AhV_83MBHXTtBWUQ_BJ6BAhyEAc', 'You\'re eligible for a Genius discount at The Gateway Hotel Beach Road! To save at this property, all you have to do is sign in.\n\nLocated 2 km from Visakhapatnam City Centre, The Gateway Hotel Beach Road features a spa, outdoor pool and 24-hour business centre. It is situated by the sea overlooking Bay of Bengal. Free parking is provided.\n\nGateway Hotel is 6 km from Visakhapatnam Railway Station. Visakhapatnam Airport is 16 km away.\n\nModern rooms offer garden or sea views. A flat-screen cable TV, minibar and tea/coffee-making facilities are standard in all rooms. Safety deposit boxes are provided.\n\nCourier and secretarial services are available upon request. Guests can work out at the fitness centre or head for a relaxing spa bath session. Ticketing and currency exchange services are available.\n\nGuests can enjoy the outdoor atmosphere at GAD restaurant, which offers open kitchens. Szechuan cuisine is served at Ming Garden restaurant.', 'assets/images/hotels/the-gateway-hotel-beach-road-visakhapatnam/1.webp', 1),
(398, 'H643', 'the-park-visakhapatnam', 'The Park, Visakhapatnam', 'Visakhapatnam', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'VUDA Park Light House R k, Dr NTR Beach Rd, Lawsons Bay Colony, Pedda Waltair, Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh 530023', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Park,+Visakhapatnam/@17.7214832,83.3361575,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xcea4e5d71e955b93?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjhqurz-rf7AhXO83MBHWAkDWEQ_BJ6BQiGARAH', 'The Park Visakhapatnam is an urban beach resort overlooking the Bay of Bengal. The surrounding scenic beauty is a treat to the senses and creates a very tranquil atmosphere ideal for unwinding after a hard day’s work. The resort has a private beach area and beautifully manicured gardens with tiled pavilions. One may be forgiven to think that this resort is primarily for the leisure tourist however this is not the case, in fact quite the opposite - majority of the hotel’s guests come on work-related activities. The hotel is conveniently located and offers swift access to the city’s local railway and airport facilities (15 and 30 mins away respectively by car). The dining experience that you get here offers an unparalleled experience enhanced by the backdrop of orange sunsets and the glittering calmness of the sea. Bamboo Bay in its refurbished avatar reflects the rich ethnic heritage of East Indian tribal culture in a uniquely chic way. While Vista offers a highly appetizing spread ranging from Pan-Indian to authentic Italian gourmet food.', 'assets/images/hotels/the-park-visakhapatnam/1.webp', 1),
(399, 'VRN02', 'hotel-radha-ashok', 'Hotel Radha Ashok', 'Vrindavan', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'INTERNAL', 'hotels', 'Hotel Radha Ashok, Main Road, Vrindavan, India', 'https://maps.google.com/?q=Hotel%20Radha%20Ashok%20Vrindavan', 'Experience luxury hospitality at Hotel Radha Ashok in Vrindavan, featuring modern amenities and exceptional service.', 'assets/images/hotels/hotel-radha-ashok/1.webp', 1),
(400, 'VRN01', 'nidhivan-sarovar-portico', 'Nidhivan Sarovar Portico', 'Vrindavan', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', 'HOTEL', 'ASSOCIATED', 'hotels', 'Nidhivan Sarovar Portico, Main Road, Vrindavan, India', 'https://maps.google.com/?q=Nidhivan%20Sarovar%20Portico%20Vrindavan', 'Experience luxury hospitality at Nidhivan Sarovar Portico in Vrindavan, featuring modern amenities and exceptional service.', 'assets/images/hotels/nidhivan-sarovar-portico/1.webp', 1)
